  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Strategic Communications Support Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAIDs Strategic Communications Support Activity works with the Government of the Republic of Armenia to put in place effective, streamlined, data-driven, and citizen-centered strategic communications systems, capacities, and practices. The Activity will focus on enabling the institutional set up and talent management for the public sectors streamlined strategic communication, ensuring institutionalized systems and capacity for data-driven information management to inform and foster citizen-centered strategic communications and public outreach.</narrative>
  </description>
